==Quest Start==
Talk to Wizard Schrock in the [[Plane of Sky]].

You say, 'hail Wizard Schrock'
:''Wizard Schrock says 'Greetings.  Do you believe that you are a great wizard? ''
You say, 'I am a great and powerful wizard'
:''Wizard Schrock says 'I will not take your word for it!  You must prove your greatness to my apprentices.  Do you wish to be tested by Neasin or by Abec? ''

= Neasin Leornic =

You say, 'I wish to be tested by neasin'
:''Wizard Schrock says 'Neasin it shall be.  Take this book and read it.  When you are finished, hand it back to me and I shall summon the mighty wizard Neasin to test you. ''
:''Wizard Schrock says 'Farewell. ''
:''Neasin Leornic says 'I am here to do your bidding, Wizard Spirit! ''
:''Wizard Schrock says 'Till next time!  Farewell! ''
You say, 'hail Neasin Leornic'
:''Neasin Leornic says 'Welcome.  I am apprentice Neasin.  Do you wish to test your powers? ''
You say, 'I wish to test my powers'
:''Neasin Leornic says 'Great, let us waste no more time!  Whichh test do you wish to begin, the test of concentration, focus, or meditation? ''

== Wizard Test of Concentration ==

Neasin Leornic says 'Concentration is of the utmost importance to a wizard.  Without it, we cannot cast even the most simple dweomer.  Proceed upward through the sky and return to me an azure tessera, an augmentor's gem, and a grey damask cloak.  This will prove your ability to concentrate and I will reward you with an Augmentor's Mask. 

'''Reward:''' {{:Augmentor's Mask}}

