== Wizard Test of Meditation ==

Neasin Leornic says 'A wizard is nothing without meditation.  Meditation allows us to focus and concentrate when casting our spells of power.  Fly to those above and return to me a hyaline globe, a sky topaz, and high quality raiment.  If you are successful, I will reward you with the Raiment of Thunder. 

'''Reward:''' {{:Raiment of Thunder}}

