= Abec Lanor =

You say, 'I wish to be tested by abec'
:''Wizard Schrock says 'Abec it shall be.  Take this book ([[Knowledge and Power]]) and read it.  When you are finished, hand it back to me and I shall summon the mighty wizard Abec to test you. ''
:''Wizard Schrock says 'Farewell. ''
:''Wizard Schrock says 'Till next time!  Farewell! ''
:''Abec Ianor says 'I am here to do your bidding, Wizard Spirit!'' 
You say, 'hail Abec Ianor'
:''Abec Ianor says 'Welcome.  I am Apprentice Abec.  Do you wish to test your powers?  Or have you already finished all your tests? ''
You say, 'I have already finished all tests'
:''Abec Ianor says 'We recently gave out a batch of inferior Amulets of Planar Transference.  If you bring me one of these I will gladly replace it with an upgraded version.  After all, you earned it, right?''
You say, 'I wish to test my powers'
:''Abec Ianor says 'Great, let us waste no more time!  Do you wish to begin your test of conception, visualization, or preparation?''

